<p>You consume all Miasma Engine stacks you have to fire a blast of corrosive death through your steamgun, dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">135%, 150%, 161%, 171%, 180%</acronym> weapon damage as acid in a radius 1 cone with a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 39%, 52%, 61%, 68%</acronym> chance to remove a random beneficial physical or mental effect. For every stack beyond the first the damage dealt is increased by 50% and there is a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 39%, 52%, 61%, 68%</acronym> chance to remove an additional effect.</p><p>This attack ignores all enemy armour, and you must have at least 1 stack of Miasma Engine to use this talent.</p>